## Model routing
- Default bulk: gpt-3.5-turbo
- Summary & advanced Q&A: gpt-4o
- Switch to gpt-4o-mini when env USE_MINI=true

## Interview distribution
- If persona_pack == "broad", evenly split interviews across personas.
- If "custom", generate persona first via GPT-4o prompt.

## Chat feature
- Endpoint /chat accepts job_id + question.
- Must stream answer; reuse report JSON where possible.
- Max 1 000 chat turns / month / Starter seat.

## Code standards
- pytest ≥ 80 %  
- OPENAI_API_KEY, DB creds via env only  
- Respect file layout /workflows /reports /chat /tests
